ideas/meta-protocol-change-fusion-execplans/round-01/codex.md:114:Parley-deck's Phase 1 already gives independent analyses from named participants before anchoring. It is stronger than Fusion's opaque panel because every participant's file is durable, attributable, and reviewable. The roster, quorum, and one-file-per-agent mechanics are better suited to protocol work than a dynamic panel of up to eight hidden model calls.
