ideas/loop-engineering-research/consensus.md:62:| LE-5 | **Unified loop-budget contract** — one `LoopBudget` carrying max driver-steps, max rounds, max fixup-cycles, max wall-clock, max cost; **budget hit = escalate, never mark complete**. Consolidates today's fragmented caps (`loop.go:16` hard-coded 30m, `driver.go` `MaxRounds`/`MaxFixupCycles`, `pipeline auto` `maxCycles=3` + wave cap). Protocol states *that* limits exist; CLI/`[defaults]` state the numbers | Protocol `COOPERATION.md` §4/§9.0/§12; CLI `internal/driver/{driver,loop}.go`, `internal/runmanifest`, flags `--max-driver-steps/--max-wall-clock/--max-cost-usd/--max-rounds/--max-fixup-cycles`; `~/.parley [defaults.loop]` | Stopping conditions / hard limits | M | **Adopt** | `driver-loop-budgets` |
